Major-Chaplain Ewan McFoster is the deputy director of the [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Magical Crimes/index|Magical Crimes Convox]] in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. He speaks for the convox in public, including on [[The Situation Room|the radio]].

He holds that illegal [[Phenomena/Augury|augury]] caused the endless rain over the city. In his account, looking too far down the world tree strains it and brings blowback, which is why Calaria keeps strict augury allotments since the Incident of 24. Past blowback, he says, has meant darkness for days or trouble moving from one part of the [[Infinite Horizon|Horizon]] to another, and he believes the loss of Star 13 at Tor's Strand came from the same cause.
